{"schemaVersion":1,"code":"C1-06","example":{"issue":{"title":"巷弄多叉路口，環境是否以行人為主？","intro":"多條街巷交會，現況空間與資訊不足以清楚引導行人及車輛。","images":[{"key":"results:c1-06-diagram-1","label":"現況圖","role":"diagram","rotation":0},{"key":"results:c1-06-diagram-2","label":"現況圖 2","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"crop":[133.369,72.786,2012.987,1326.17]},{"key":"results:c1-06-photo-1","label":"現況照片","role":"photo","rotation":0},{"key":"results:c1-06-photo-2","label":"現況照片 2","role":"photo","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"speed","title":"路口未形成減速環境","text":"交叉口的空間與標線配置，未能有效提醒駕駛減速。"},{"id":"pedestrian","title":"步行空間不足","text":"行人在巷弄與路口間缺少完整的通行空間。"},{"id":"direction","title":"道路幾何與方向難辨識","text":"缺少岔路提示與巷道路名資訊，不易提早選擇方向。"}],"photoStatus":"available"},"sourceSlides":[110,111],"strategy":{"title":"以路型調整降低街巷道車速","intro":"縮減過寬的行車空間，讓多叉街巷道的路型與減速需求更清楚。","images":[{"key":"results:c1-06-strategy","label":"整體佈設圖","rotation":0}],"items":[{"id":"alignment","title":"調整線型與車道寬度","text":"以標線修整道路線型、車道寬度及交角，減少車輛快速穿越路口的空間。","moduleId":"M1-01"},{"id":"warning","title":"提前提示多叉路型","text":"在上游設置岔路標誌，讓駕駛及早辨識前方路口並調整行駛方式。","moduleId":"M4-01"},{"id":"calming","title":"逐步形成交通寧靜環境","text":"以整體配置建立低速街巷道意象，長期可配合實體設施引導駕駛減速。","moduleId":"M4-04"}]},"strategySource":{"file":"chapters/05-complex-scenarios/05-1-06-alleys-multi-leg-intersection.typ","sha256":"fe72ea02926e76f88420e81e77579c25cb469879a34f95ba797e3a00a24183d9","scenario":"C1-06","title":"街巷道多叉路口","section":"交通設施設置建議與整體設置圖例"}},"assets":{"results:c1-06-diagram-1":{"file":"materials/05-複雜道路情境/current-conditions/C1-06/C1-06_現況圖_01.png","width":4138,"height":2668,"label":"C1-06 現況圖","scenario":"C1-06","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":110,"sourcePart":"ppt/media/image134.png","sha256":"28d1467d8c7bc18bc7b55898d7bd13e651266c19a0aa17247eeb1b78a2bee87c"},"results:c1-06-diagram-2":{"file":"materials/05-複雜道路情境/current-conditions/C1-06/C1-06_現況圖_02.png","width":2199,"height":1418,"label":"C1-06 現況圖 2","scenario":"C1-06","role":"diagram","rotation":0,"sourceSlide":111,"sourc